{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19082","headline":"重送浙西李相公顷廉问江南已经七载後歴滑台剑南两镇遂入相今复领旧地新加旌旄 · 刘禹锡","name":"重送浙西李相公顷廉问江南已经七载後歴滑台剑南两镇遂入相今复领旧地新加旌旄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江北万人看玉节，江南千骑引金铙。\n凤从池上游沧海，鹤到辽东识旧巢。\n城下清波含百谷，窻中远岫列三茅。\n碧鸡白马回翔久，却忆朱方是乐郊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19082.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19082","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}